<mxCell id="g123" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;fontColor=#555555;" value="已有 14-AI agent/1-LangChain/2-LangGraph进阶.vector.drawio 讲 HITL / Subgraph / Multi-Agent / update_state 修复；本篇只讲基础与 Graph API，二者互补不重复。" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="30" width="1480" x="60" y="862" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
